        "id": 9870,
        "name": "Reckless",
        "username": "Reckless",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-12T15:26:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I couldn’t help but notice that Setback’s backstory mentions that all of his hair fell out after Blade’s treatment, but nothing is said of it growing back.</p>\n<p>We can’t see any eyebrows due to his mask, but he seems to have a head full of spiky brown hair. I don’t know that we have any pictures of him pretreatment. We do know that his luck deals in extremes, so I could see him not getting his hair back. That leaves me with a few questions…</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Is that a wig or Setback’s own regrown hair?</li>\n<li>If not, is that what his hair looked like before it fell out?</li>\n</ol>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:40:46.341Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 2,
